go.style.1 #handler-guide line 1 should "Handler guide" TODO "the heading carries no strength word; set the rule and its strength"
go.style.2 #logging line 7 must "Handlers MUST log once per request."
go.style.3 #logging line 8 must "Handlers MUST NOT log secrets."
go.style.4 #logging line 9 should "Handlers SHOULD log at the edge."
go.style.5 #errors line 13 must "An error MUST be wrapped with context."
go.style.6 #errors line 14 must "An error MUST be handled once."
go.style.7 #retries line 18 must "A retry MUST be bounded."
go.style.8 #retries line 19 may "A retry MAY use jitter."
go.style.9 #timeouts line 23 must "Every call MUST carry a deadline."
go.style.10 #timeouts line 24 must "A deadline MUST come from the caller and SHOULD be short." TODO "the line carries MUST and SHOULD; keep one strength"
go.style.11 #naming line 28 must "Exported names MUST NOT stutter."
go.style.12 #naming line 29 must "Test names MUST say the case."
